  "content": "<h1>Создать: Дымоходы</h1><hr><h2>Требования:</h2><h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bjornlib/files/5500491\" rel=\"nofollow\">BjornLib-1.0.17.8+</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></h3><h1>&nbsp;</h1><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5ea4a80b-9e1b-47a0-824b-06cc4e685c15.gif\" width=\"649\" height=\"366\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98fc4459-6f67-4fa4-bbf0-ae6107bca282.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a3ae55b6-36f7-4ee4-b8fa-d83d19d2957e.png\" width=\"476\" height=\"532\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Рецепт</h2><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_26c52fb8-f827-4765-a273-1b21213ff9d1.png\"></p><h3>Лоток + Костёр = Дымоход</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1056947/description_17350356-46fb-4836-a904-3eb35ccc5617.png\" width=\"515\" height=\"237\"></p><h3>Варианты дымоходов можно получить, окружив дымоход материалом.</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Другие мои моды</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-witcher-world-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1238/873/638810960517569231.png\" alt=\"Мир Ведьмака\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pirates-treasures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1031/133/638553772546353962.png\" alt=\"Пираты и Сокровища\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1060/665/638592491337254994.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft: Дерево навыков\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-runes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1075/81/638612119101538942.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft: Руны\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy-dragon-breaths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1321/883/638859416236963261.png\" alt=\"Dragon Mounts Legacy: Дыхание драконов\" width=\"129\" height=\"129\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-chimneys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/933/638722416788508737.png\" alt=\"Create: Дымоходы\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-remastered-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f9c9d0fe-6f33-43fd-aab5-a7c630a57aea.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/935/638722417025475522.jpeg\" alt=\"Dragon Mounts Legacy: Больше драконов\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_ac376303-3148-4c79-8aed-7571077c0017.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
